   "kind": "assistant_text",
   "text": "The trigger fired, confirming the extend_best move was unproductive (negative gain of -0.0691). The harness is now waiting for me to act on this. Since this licenses a stop, let me revert to the better single-feature spec and try one more move \u2014 a `pick` to compare a couple of candidate single/swap options, or just finalize with the best single feature found (0.9234), which is solid and robust (single feature, less overfitting risk).\n\nGiven I've used 2 of my 3 content moves (init, extend_best), I have one move left. Let me try `swap_worst` on my current 2-feature holding to see if it finds something better than the plain single-feature result."
